<li>Defines a linkable resource <code>NeonDB</code> that exposes the <code>connectionString</code> property from the Neon project.</li>
<li>Creates an AWS Lambda function named <code>MyApi</code> using the handler defined in <code>src/index.ts</code>, and links it to the <code>NeonDB</code> resource. This makes the connection string available to the Lambda function.</li>
</ol>
